WEBVTT

NOTE Transcript of the narration

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.500
27 July 2022: China opens its
doors to fresh Vietnamese durian.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.800
This is Durian Passport.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.800
Your mission: take Vietnamese durian
to the world over six seasons.

4
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.100
Meet Bà Sáu Lành, a grower in Cái Lậy.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.600
80% of exporters' fruit
still comes through traders.

6
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.700
To go official, every box needs two codes:

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.900
one for the planting area,
one for the packing facility.

8
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.000
No code, no entry.

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.100
The phytosanitary protocol between
Vietnam and China sets the rules.

10
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Meet them, and your
passport gets its stamp.

11
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.800
From the Mekong Delta, six
channels reach the market:

12
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:49.600
official trade, border trade, frozen
durian, Taiwan, Japan and premium buyers.

13
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.000
Each one is a different entry mode,
with its own risks and rewards.

14
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.397
Your team has five roles:
CEO, CMO, COO, CFO and SEC.

15
00:00:58.397 --> 00:01:02.213
Together you run one
link of the export chain,

16
00:01:02.213 --> 00:01:05.200
and every decision has consequences.

17
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:07.798
You won't be alone.

18
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:13.400
Three AI rivals, drawn from seven international
CEOs, compete for the same market.

19
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.710
Play six seasons, from July 2022 to 2025.

20
00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:22.800
Each one follows a real milestone,
and each one changes the game.

21
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.457
Stuck? Ask Lumina.

22
00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:32.600
She explains, then asks you questions
back. She never just gives you the answer.

23
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.581
Durian Passport. Walk the
3D map at bizonland.com.

24
00:01:37.581 --> 00:01:39.300
It runs in your browser.
